{"title":"Weball allows you to roll up websites into a Katamari...","link":"https://kottke.org/26/10/0049767-weball","date":1791567480000,"content":"\n         \t<p><a href=\"https://www.funwithcomputervision.com/weball\">Weball</a> allows you to roll up websites into a Katamari ball. <a href=\"https://www.funwithcomputervision.com/weball?url=https%3A%2F%2Fkottke.org\">You can even roll up KDO</a>. This is too much fun. See also <a href=\"https://kottke.org/26/09/0049710-destroy-kottkeorg\">Destroy Any Website</a>.\n</p>\n \n\n        \n        \n        \n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"ef48e246c944ba37244036070618265e483cf3ecffaa8fb5b8f9d12669fc7b9f","category":"Sites"}